WEBVTT

00:10:59.314 --> 00:11:03.988
that each one of us actually has
the power to do something about.

00:11:04.012 --> 00:11:08.169
So if we each do our part, together,
we can make a difference,

00:11:08.193 --> 00:11:11.207
and we can help keep
penguins from going extinct.

00:11:11.622 --> 00:11:15.048
Humans have always been the greatest
threat to penguins,

00:11:15.072 --> 00:11:17.167
but we are now their only hope.

00:11:17.191 --> 00:11:18.342
Thank you.

00:11:18.366 --> 00:11:23.111
(Applause)